@Nadia Fennimore: Gideon's final number for Vantorre Group in his July 1 update was **280 seats**. He first posted 300, then corrected it a couple of minutes later. The 300 came from a staging tab that included sandbox logins from the May rollout. 280 is the active seat count on the production roster as of July 1. Ruth confirmed the corrected figure in the channel.

Use 280 on the roster sheet. This is the July figure, so it may have changed since.
